            x: 5,
            y: 15,
            item_name: "",
            image: "",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("Not far from here is a place of old magic; a burial ground once prepared for one of our lords of old. It was never used, but remains a place of great peace and rest. You say Deoran has sought you out; I believe he has sought out this tomb."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("If we can lure him into the tomb without destroying him, his tired bones may at last find the peace they have so long been denied. And your tired heart may at last find closure, great-granddaughter."),
          },
        ],
      },
